  "title": "Fondant Potatoes",
  "description": "Chef John&#39;s fondant potatoes are braised in butter and stock until golden and crisp on the outside with a rich, creamy interior for an elegant side.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2013-06-28T15:30:06-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-03-11T19:10:00-04:00",
