  "keywords": [
    "publisher-tested"
  ],
  "ingredients": [
    "3 large whole russet potatoes",
    "2 tablespoons high-heat-resistant vegetable oil, such as grapeseed oil",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "3 tablespoons butter",
    "4 sprigs thyme, plus more for garnish",
    "0.5 cup chicken broth, or more as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut off potato ends; stand potatoes on end and peel from top to bottom with a sharp knife to make each potato into a uniform cylinder. Cut each cylinder in half crosswise to make 6 potato cylinders, each about 2 inches long.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NfNgdJtEiTTwgBQWU-myUxhGc0M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233295-FondantPotatoes-mfs-Step1-0067-968bc378a3e24db489f55f8e86e44990.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233295/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place potatoes into a bowl of cold water for about 5 minutes to remove starch from the outsides.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4znLEvF5Yc9uQ2-sLVha3CxyKLI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233295-FondantPotatoes-mfs-Step2-0068-c1026c9c22844c649acc65411a1dbc73.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233295/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat vegetable oil in a heavy oven-proof skillet over high heat until slightly shimmers.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Pat potato cylinders dry with paper towels; place cylinders with the best-looking ends into the hot oil. Reduce heat to medium-high; fry until well-browned, 5 to 6 minutes. Season with salt and black pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/afDBC2aGCZDAF30uKPl5SYRMsSY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233295-FondantPotatoes-mfs-Step3-0088-6993928810cb4db1803a900a57b90e8a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233295/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Flip potatoes; repeat on other ends. Blot out oil from the skillet carefully using a paper towel held with tongs as they cook. Add butter and thyme sprigs to the skillet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Paint butter over tops of potatoes with a thyme sprig using tongs. Cook until butter foams and foam turns from white to a pale tan color. Season with salt and black pepper. Pour chicken stock into the skillet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bF2iqlbxGHlx0BrCysakclLYVqA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233295-FondantPotatoes-mfs-Step3-0101-211646d5fa734555bfe9f17c889cc96a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233295/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer the skillet to the preheated oven; cook until potatoes are tender and creamy inside, about 30 minutes. Add ¼ cup more stock if potatoes aren't tender and cook 10 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/i_duhgUIJrti0e4NMpQFDxBGDAo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233295-FondantPotatoes-mfs-Step4-0127-596a2c804ebd4fc398ba9daa83247f05.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233295/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place potatoes on a serving platter. Spoon thyme-infused butter remaining in skillet over potatoes. Garnish with thyme sprigs. Cool before serving, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MVj_D4Y6JlWFECPBI16IuozWry8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233295-fondant-potatoes-DDMFS-4x3-f78b15d1968148c8afc4c28ffaaa2473.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233295/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
